Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}大家好 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Alright, hello everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.30,0:00:13.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}在这个视频中 我想向大家展示我偶然发现的一种新型恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.30,0:00:13.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}In this video I want to show you the new type of malware that I've stumbled upon.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.78,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}其实它并不算特别新 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.86,0:00:16.78,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's actually not super new,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.06,0:00:18.74,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}已经存在好几个月了 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.06,0:00:18.74,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}it's been out there for months,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.94,0:00:25.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但它仍然在互联网上四处传播 之所以引起我的注意 是因为它看起来相当逼真 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.94,0:00:21.54,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it's still scattered around the internet and it 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:25.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}caught my eye because it seems kind of plausible,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.18,0:00:30.10,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}如果你没有使用DNS广告拦截器或任何广告拦截扩展 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.18,0:00:30.10,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And if you aren't using a DNS adblocker or really any adblock extension,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你应该使用uBlock 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}you should be using uBlock,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.64,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}显然 Chrome通过Manifest版本3禁用了它 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.80,0:00:35.64,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}obviously, but I think Chrome banned it with Manifest version 3.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.24,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不过你还在坚持使用广告拦截器 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.12,0:00:38.24,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And you should still be using an adblocker,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.24,0:00:38.46,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.24,0:00:38.46,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}right?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}如果你不使用广告拦截器 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.08,0:00:40.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Well, if you don't use an adblocker,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.12,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你可能会遇到这种情况 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.12,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}you might encounter this.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.08,0:00:54.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs109\blur10}如你所见 我现在正在运行一个恶意软件 后台正在下载一个二次元塔防（Tower Defense）游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:00:43.08,0:00:48.79,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So, as you can see, I'm in the middle of a malware run right now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:54.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and there are anime TDs downloading in the background.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.48,0:01:00.10,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我是从某个该死的广告中得到的 我其实不确定它是不是恶意软件 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:54.48,0:01:00.10,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I got this from some freaking ad and I'm not actually sure whether it's a malware or not.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.88,0:01:03.60,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我能下载吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:02.88,0:01:03.60,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I can download?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.89,0:01:07.89,Newman-CN-4K,注释,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(3084,1872)}*游戏名：胜利女神：新的希望*
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}看看这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:03.84,0:01:05.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh my god, look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.00,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我能下这个二次元游戏？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.48,0:01:08.00,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I can get anime TDs on my computer?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.70,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}9MB
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.70,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}9 megabytes.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.04,0:01:10.98,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我能相信这个吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.04,0:01:10.98,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Do I trust this?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.70,0:01:15.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但我们迟早会在下载时发现 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.70,0:01:15.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}But we're gonna find sooner or later when it downloads.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.52,0:01:17.56,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}管它怎样呢 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:16.52,0:01:17.56,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So yeah, anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.92,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}反垃圾邮件 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:18.56,0:01:19.92,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Anti-spam.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.22,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}正在检查与网站连接的安全性 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.90,0:01:23.22,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Checking the security of connection to the site.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.98,0:01:26.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}网站需要检查你连接的安全性 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.98,0:01:26.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}The site needs to check the security of your connection.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.30,0:01:28.10,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但与此同时 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.30,0:01:28.10,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}But at the same time,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.18,0:01:38.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs109\blur10}你无法真正知道 因为现在大多数网站都在使用Cloudflare 而Cloudflare通常在网站加载时
Dialogue: 2,0:01:28.18,0:01:33.86,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}you can't really know because most websites right now are using Cloudflare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:38.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and Cloudflare usually enforces a bug check
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.33,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}一开始就强制执行错误检查 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.74,0:01:41.33,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}at the very start when the site is being loaded.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.50,0:01:45.18,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这显然是在试图模仿那种状态 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.50,0:01:45.18,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And this is clearly trying to mock that state.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.86,0:01:49.40,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}首先 我不认为谷歌会这样做 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.86,0:01:49.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Well, first of all, I don't think Google does this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.48,0:01:56.01,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}唯一会进行这种错误检查的服务商是Cloudflare 这算是在模仿它  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.48,0:01:54.23,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}The only provider that does this kind of a bug check is Cloudflare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.23,0:01:56.01,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and it's kind of mocking that.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.48,0:02:00.76,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你得点击复选框才能完成验证  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.48,0:02:00.76,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And the idea is you have to click on the checkbox to fill it in.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.98,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}那我们点击会发生什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.84,0:02:03.98,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So what happens when we click?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.56,0:02:07.16,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}砰！  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.56,0:02:07.16,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}BAM!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.50,0:02:11.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你就会被重定向到恶意网站  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.50,0:02:11.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}You get redirected to the malicious website.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.34,0:02:12.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}精彩  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.34,0:02:12.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Amazing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.96,0:02:18.72,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}让我们看看这个网站的开发者控制台  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:14.96,0:02:18.72,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So let's check out the developer console for this website.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.06,0:02:22.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}就会发现它其实是假的  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.06,0:02:22.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And see that it's actually bogus.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.14,0:02:23.54,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不是真正的验证系统  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:22.14,0:02:23.54,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's not a real recapture.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.80,0:02:27.18,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}实际上 每次你点击页面主体时
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.80,0:02:27.18,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And in fact, whenever you click on the body,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.46,0:02:28.34,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}无论点击页面任何位置  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.46,0:02:28.34,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}anywhere on the body,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.86,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你都会被传送到这个“宝地”
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.86,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}you get resurrected to this gem here.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.78,0:02:35.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Limner's Little Shop.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.24,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}实际上  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.24,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And as a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.26,0:02:42.32,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我们可以复制这段代码 尝试在重定向之外运行  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:38.26,0:02:42.32,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}we can copy that and try running it outside the redirect.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.44,0:02:44.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}看吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.44,0:02:44.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And here we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.78,0:02:45.64,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}会话已过期  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.78,0:02:45.64,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Session expired.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.93,0:02:51.39,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但当我们点击这里  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.93,0:02:51.39,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}But when we click here,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.63,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}哦对 还是会显示会话过期  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:51.55,0:02:53.63,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}oh, yeah, we still get the session expired thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.25,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}没错 它显然被硬编码成会把你重定向到那个恶意小网站
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.47,0:02:58.25,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Yeah, it's definitely hard-coded to redirect you to that little malicious site here.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.83,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我可以用自己的网站复现这个效果  
Dialogue: 2,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.83,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I can make this happen with my site.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.97,0:03:04.01,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它能把我重定向到个人网站  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.97,0:03:04.01,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It can redirect me to my personal website.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.19,0:03:04.65,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}哦耶  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:04.19,0:03:04.65,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.74,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我可真是个黑客  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.60,0:03:08.74,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'm such a hacker.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.72,0:03:15.48,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}其实还有另一种伪造网站版本 它伪装成Cloudflare  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.72,0:03:13.28,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Anyway, there's actually another rendition of such a fake site
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.28,0:03:15.48,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and it's impersonating Cloudflare.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.58,0:03:24.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}记得Discord上有粉丝发过截图 是个虚假的Cloudflare机器人验证  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.58,0:03:19.29,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I remember a fan on Discord sent me a screenshot
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:24.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}of a fake Cloudflare bot check and it was suggesting you download a
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}页面要求你下载文件才能通过验证  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}file in order to pass the bot check.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.36,0:03:32.16,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}那可比眼前这个有意思多了  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.36,0:03:32.16,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And that is definitely heaps more interesting than this guy right here.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.40,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}找到那个才是我最终目标  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.38,0:03:35.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And that's my ultimate goal to find that.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.52,0:03:40.92,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这类恶意软件最特别之处在于存活期极短
Dialogue: 2,0:03:36.52,0:03:40.92,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What's really exceptional about this type of malware is how short-lived it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.34,0:03:47.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}就像我刚录完这个网站 转眼间就再也打不开了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.34,0:03:45.39,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}As in, I just finished recording and reviewing this website
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.39,0:03:47.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and I can no longer get into it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.72,0:03:51.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我再也无法重现那个虚假的验证码了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.72,0:03:51.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I can no longer generate that fake reCAPTCHA again.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.42,0:03:56.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}即便我再次运行那个网站
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.42,0:03:56.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And say, even if I run that website again,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.66,0:03:58.46,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}直接显示“会话已过期”
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.66,0:03:58.46,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}it just says session expired.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.42,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它再也不让我进去了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.72,0:04:00.42,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It doesn't allow me in anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.40,0:04:06.62,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以 我这次纯粹是运气爆棚  而且没给任何可乘之机
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.40,0:04:06.62,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So, yeah, I pretty much just got really lucky and I didn't take any chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.84,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我立刻就开始录屏
Dialogue: 2,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.84,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I started recording right off the bat and,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.04,0:04:19.26,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不过这一切都值得  因为接下来两三个小时  我都要寻找这样的“宝藏”网站
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.04,0:04:13.03,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}well, it kind of paid off because
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.03,0:04:19.26,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'll be searching for like the next two or three hours for another gem like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.70,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}那就待会儿见
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.96,0:04:21.70,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So I'll see you then.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.00,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}跳过广告？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.80,0:04:25.00,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Skip ad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.46,0:04:32.46,Newman-CN-4K,注释,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(3396,1876)}*网易瞩目*
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.08,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.48,0:04:29.08,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What is going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.80,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}又是一个游戏 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's another game.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.24,0:04:41.18,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我给我的电脑申请了一个恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.24,0:04:41.18,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I have requested a malware for my computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.74,0:04:44.62,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不过不是这种恶意软件
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.74,0:04:44.62,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Well, not this type of malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.34,0:04:52.04,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}界面上叠着一堆弹窗...
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.34,0:04:52.04,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}There are a bunch of overlays that are...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.82,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}(⊙o⊙) 又来一个
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.82,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, another one.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.34,0:04:55.98,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}好的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:55.34,0:04:55.98,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.04,0:04:58.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以现在又冒出来一个
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.04,0:04:58.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So we've got another one just now.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.16,0:05:00.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}而且这看起来也不太可信
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.16,0:05:00.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And it's not really that plausible,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.40,0:05:03.72,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但我觉得 我们方向是对的 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.40,0:05:03.72,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but I mean, we're on the right track,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.84,0:05:04.12,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你知道的 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.84,0:05:04.12,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.86,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}请验证您是人类 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.00,0:05:06.86,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Please verify that you are a human.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.32,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}请按照以下步骤完成验证
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.32,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Follow the steps for verification.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}点击此处进行验证
Dialogue: 2,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Click here to verify.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.72,0:05:12.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}好的 
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.72,0:05:12.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.56,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以我们又遇到一个更有趣的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.56,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So we've got an even more interesting one.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.64,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以按下Windows键加R键
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.64,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So press the Windows button plus R,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.00,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}按下Ctrl+V组合键 然后按回车键
Dialogue: 2,0:05:19.32,0:05:21.00,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}press control V and press enter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.18,0:05:30.44,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs105\blur10}所以这里的陷阱在于  他们把一个恶意链接复制到了我的剪贴板  现在又诱导我通过运行窗口执行它
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.18,0:05:26.31,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So the idea here is they copied a malicious link into my clipboard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:30.44,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and now they're asking to run it through my run box.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.74,0:05:34.90,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这肯定是个PowerShell脚本  要么就是MSHTA恶意程序
Dialogue: 2,0:05:30.74,0:05:34.90,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's gonna be a PowerShell script or MSHTA.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.22,0:05:36.42,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}有意思  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.22,0:05:36.42,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}That's interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.88,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}为什么是MSHTA呢？  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.00,0:05:38.88,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So why is it MSHTA?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:45.89,Newman-CN-4K,注释,0,0,0,,{\fs89\blur10\pos(2380,1892)}*MSHTA，全称Microsoft HTML Application Host，是微软Windows系统中的一个可执行程序，\N用于执行HTML应用程序（HTA）文件。\N可以被用于绕过某些应用程序控制解决方案，因为它在IE的安全上下文之外运行*
Dialogue: 1,0:05:39.68,0:05:40.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}算了 直接运行吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:39.68,0:05:40.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, anyway, let's run it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.88,0:05:41.74,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}其实无所谓了  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.88,0:05:41.74,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.93,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它肯定会下载些恶意软件  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.55,0:05:48.93,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's gonna download some malware.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.23,0:05:50.11,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}肯定会干点什么  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:49.23,0:05:50.11,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's gonna do something.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.83,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}肯定没好事  
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.83,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's gonna do something bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}CPU占用51%  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}51% CPU.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.54,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}看来运行得很欢实啊  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:01.92,0:06:04.54,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It must be doing great.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.06,0:06:09.50,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}看 它启动了CMD
Dialogue: 2,0:06:06.06,0:06:09.50,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, see, it started the command processor.
