Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.24,0:06:24.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Check out the command line,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.36,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}看能不能找到  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.92,0:06:26.36,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}if I can find it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.70,0:06:26.90,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}好了  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.70,0:06:26.90,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}All right.
