Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.68,0:06:28.26,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Where is it?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.28,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}命令行  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.28,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Command line.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.42,0:06:29.64,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}对  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.42,0:06:29.64,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Yes.
