Dialogue: 2,0:06:31.02,0:06:33.54,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And I want to... come on,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}给我...
Dialogue: 2,0:06:33.60,0:06:34.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}give me...
