Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}CMDC, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.74,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}文件是什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.68,0:06:39.74,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What's the file?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.02,0:06:40.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}文件是什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.02,0:06:40.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What's the file?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.46,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}找到了  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.46,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}There it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.42,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}找到了  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.64,0:06:44.42,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}There it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.02,0:06:52.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我得快速进入临时文件夹查看这个批处理脚本  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:45.02,0:06:52.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So I need to quickly enter the temporary folder and check out this batch script.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.22,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}可能被混淆了  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.52,0:06:55.22,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's probably obfuscated,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.50,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不过无所谓  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.50,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.34,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}确实混淆了  
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.34,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, it is obfuscated.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.56,0:06:58.80,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不错
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.56,0:06:58.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.26,0:07:01.24,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}就这些了  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.26,0:07:01.24,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}That's all we get.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.82,0:07:02.88,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}完全看不懂  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:01.82,0:07:02.88,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's unreadable.
