Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.14,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}But it's running.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.26,0:07:08.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}正在我电脑上运行恶意程序  
