Dialogue: 2,0:07:09.90,0:07:13.22,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I do not know exactly what it is,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但肯定非常危险  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.28,0:07:15.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it's something really bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.34,0:07:18.44,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不是挖矿程序  
