Dialogue: 2,0:07:18.76,0:07:21.26,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}There's no way it's a miner.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.95,0:07:31.51,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}PowerShell  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.95,0:07:31.51,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}PowerShell.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.81,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这里调用PowerShell要干什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.81,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What is PowerShell here for?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.35,0:07:39.75,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}哦 哦 它还在从GitHub下载东西  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.35,0:07:39.75,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, oh, it's downloading something from GitHub as well.
