Dialogue: 2,0:07:43.87,0:07:44.19,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}No, wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.89,0:07:48.37,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}怎么复制这该死的命令行  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.89,0:07:48.37,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}How do I copy the freaking command line?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.84,0:07:55.80,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}有了有了  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:54.84,0:07:55.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.02,0:07:57.24,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我就是要找这个  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:56.02,0:07:57.24,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}That's what I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.86,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}现在终止进程 我们自己下载  
