Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.92,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我本来就想这么做  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.92,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}That's what I was trying to do.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.21,0:08:14.89,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}好 我先结束MSHTA进程 然后...打开记事本  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:08.21,0:08:14.89,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Okay, I'm gonna kill the MSHTA and I'm gonna... I'm gonna open Notepad.
