Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.35,0:08:18.31,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Find the command line here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.15,0:08:25.55,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}有意思  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.15,0:08:25.55,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.75,0:08:26.89,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这是自动生成的吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:25.75,0:08:26.89,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Is this auto-generated?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.11,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}等等 什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.09,0:08:30.11,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.13,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}哦 等等  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.13,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:31.37,0:08:37.51,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}会不会是这个导致下载失败？  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:31.37,0:08:37.51,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Could this be the reason why it's not downloading?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.27,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不 这是个私有仓库  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:39.87,0:08:42.27,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}No, it's a private repository.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.15,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}你看不到内容  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:43.85,0:08:45.15,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}You can't see what it is,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.33,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但确实托管在GitHub上  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.33,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it's hosted on GitHub.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.39,0:08:49.57,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}选择GitHub托管的原因  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:47.39,0:08:49.57,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And the reason it's hosted on GitHub is,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:49.71,0:08:54.17,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我猜是为了绕过杀毒软件  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:49.71,0:08:54.17,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I think, because otherwise it would trigger the defender,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:54.39,0:08:55.61,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}既然是从GitHub下载  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:54.39,0:08:55.61,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it's downloading from GitHub,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.23,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}那问题出在哪？  
Dialogue: 2,0:08:55.79,0:08:57.23,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}so what's the problem?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.20,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}抱歉画面晃来晃去  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.20,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'm sorry for throwing the screen around,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.30,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它正在下载zip压缩包  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.30,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but it's downloading the zip file,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.82,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}重命名为随机UUID  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.44,0:09:05.82,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}calls it a random UUID,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.82,0:09:10.52,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}然后解压到另一个随机UUID  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:05.82,0:09:10.52,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and then extracts it into another random UUID.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.74,0:09:11.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这两个UUID相同吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:10.74,0:09:11.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Are those the same?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.66,0:09:12.84,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}是的 完全一致  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:11.66,0:09:12.84,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Yes, they are the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.02,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}然后就会删除文件  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.02,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And then deletes it.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.24,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}估计还会执行程序  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:16.10,0:09:17.24,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I think it runs it as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.46,0:09:19.04,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我们来看看压缩包内容  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:17.46,0:09:19.04,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Let's check out what's inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.74,0:09:21.18,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}DLL文件  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:20.74,0:09:21.18,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}DLL.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.86,0:09:23.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}其实看不出什么门道  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:21.86,0:09:23.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Yeah, you can't really tell what's inside,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.38,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但可以使用detected it easy检测一下
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.38,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but I've got detected it easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.96,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}如果是C#或.NET写的  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.96,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}If it's C Sharp, if it's .NET,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.14,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}或许还有办法处理  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:28.08,0:09:30.14,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}we can probably do something about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.10,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}哦 原来在压缩包里  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.00,0:09:33.10,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, it's in a zip file.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.22,0:09:33.56,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}抱歉  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.22,0:09:33.56,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.04,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}是我犯蠢了  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.04,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'm stupid.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.00,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}马上解压看看  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.30,0:09:38.00,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Let me extract it real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.82,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这情况可不妙  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.68,0:09:39.82,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, yeah, this does not look good.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.50,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}相当不妙啊  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.64,0:09:42.50,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}This does not look good at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.58,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}该不会还做了混淆处理？  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.16,0:09:47.58,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, could it be obfuscated as well?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.08,0:09:52.28,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我要运行试试  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:51.08,0:09:52.28,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I'm gonna run this.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.82,0:09:54.40,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}豁出去了  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:53.82,0:09:54.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I don't care.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.32,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}直接运行吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.32,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Let's run it anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.72,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}反正就是要感染这台电脑  
Dialogue: 2,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.72,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}We're here to infect this computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.31,0:10:11.43,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它做了什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.31,0:10:11.43,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What did it do?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.69,0:10:14.85,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不如安装个追踪器看看  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:11.69,0:10:14.85,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I mean, let's install it with a tracker and see what it does.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.97,0:10:16.95,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}至少能监控部分行为  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:15.97,0:10:16.95,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}At least somewhat.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.14,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}程序崩溃了  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:20.98,0:10:22.14,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It crashed.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.44,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}为什么崩溃？  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.62,0:10:23.44,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Why did it crash?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.90,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}因为是虚拟机环境？  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.52,0:10:24.90,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Could it be because it's a VM?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.44,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}别担心  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:25.56,0:10:26.44,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Worry not.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.56,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我们用的是强化版虚拟机  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.56,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}We have a hardened VM.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.46,0:10:29.40,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}再试一次
Dialogue: 2,0:10:28.46,0:10:29.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Let's try it.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.30,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}还没运行  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.30,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Not running yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.88,0:10:33.60,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}好的  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:32.88,0:10:33.60,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}All right.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.00,0:10:35.98,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}现在运行了  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:35.00,0:10:35.98,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Running now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.62,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}控制流完全不同了  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:38.08,0:10:40.62,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, the control flow is different now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.44,0:10:44.40,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这次差异太大了  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.44,0:10:44.40,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Oh, this is so different now.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.34,0:10:48.90,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}有意思  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:48.34,0:10:48.90,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.32,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它做了什么？  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:49.08,0:10:50.32,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}What has it done?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.66,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这是当前用户的值吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:52.06,0:10:55.66,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Is that a value for the current user?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.56,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不清楚它的行为  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.94,0:11:01.56,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I don't know what it has done.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.80,0:11:07.82,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}简单说 他们给你一段shellcode  让你在本地机器上执行
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.80,0:11:07.82,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Okay, basically, they give you a shellcode and they ask you to run this on your machine.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.50,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}一旦你运行这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:07.82,0:11:09.50,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And once you run this,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.28,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}一旦执行这段shellcode
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.28,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}once you run the shellcode,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.94,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}基本上就完蛋了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:11.68,0:11:12.94,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}it's pretty much over.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.78,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}一旦运行这个  你就真的中招了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.78,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Once you run this, you're actually infected.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.72,0:11:22.08,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以大家千万要当心
Dialogue: 2,0:11:19.72,0:11:22.08,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}So be careful out there.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.80,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这是个非常简单的落地页
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's a very simple landing page.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.62,0:11:33.14,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}不知道能不能让Cloudflare的页面显示出来
Dialogue: 2,0:11:30.62,0:11:33.14,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I wonder if I can get a Cloudflare one to show up.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.36,0:11:39.62,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}总而言之 我又花了一个小时  还是没找到仿冒Cloudflare的假验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.36,0:11:39.62,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}All in all, I spent another hour and I couldn't find a fake CAPTCHA mimicking Cloudflare.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.36,0:11:43.68,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}此外 过了那个阶段后  我再没遇到过任何假验证码
Dialogue: 2,0:11:40.36,0:11:43.68,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Moreover, I didn't get any fake CAPTCHA past that point.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.48,0:11:47.00,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这种情况相当罕见  但已经存在一段时间了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:44.48,0:11:47.00,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It is pretty rare, but it's been out there for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.70,0:11:53.30,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我认为它如此特别的原因  在于其攻击性极强  本质上就是强迫用户执行shellcode
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.70,0:11:51.01,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}The reason I think it's so special is because it's super aggressive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.01,0:11:53.29,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and it basically makes the user run the shellcode
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.52,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}感染他们自己的电脑 
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.52,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}infecting their own computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.80,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}它可能在某天彻底消失
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.34,0:11:57.80,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}And it might go extinct at some point,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.12,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}尤其是如果它模仿验证码的效果不佳的话
Dialogue: 2,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.12,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}especially if it doesn't mimic the CAPTCHA well.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.04,0:12:06.06,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\fs109\blur10}不管怎样 这些落地页大多都是凭感觉编写的  而且所有GitHub上的投放器都是自动化的
Dialogue: 2,0:12:01.04,0:12:04.03,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}Either way, most of these landing pages are vibe coded
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:06.06,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}and all the GitHub droppers are automated.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.80,0:12:10.46,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}这做法相当偷懒  但毕竟我们生活在生成式AI的时代
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.80,0:12:10.46,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}It's pretty lazy, but we're after all living the age of generative AI.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.83,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}越是看似合理，越是危险
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.22,0:12:13.83,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}The more plausible it is, the more dangerous it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.40,0:12:18.20,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}我想找到Cloudflare那个案例  因为整个页面看起来相当逼真
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.40,0:12:18.20,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}I wanted to find the Cloudflare one because it all looked pretty genuine,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.34,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}但我只有一张截图
Dialogue: 2,0:12:18.98,0:12:20.34,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}but I only have a screenshot.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.02,0:12:22.16,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}原理都是一样的  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:21.02,0:12:22.16,Newman-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}The idea is the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.08,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10}所以大家务必保持警惕  
